# FreshBite
Fresh bite is restuarantA complete, self-contained food ordering web app built to satisfy the task brief: restaurant listings, menu management, cart functionality, order tracking, and payment integration — all working end-to-end in the browser with no backend required.

Features

1. Restaurant Listings

6 restaurants across 5 cuisines (Italian, Indian, Chinese, Burgers, Healthy)
Cuisine filter chips + live search (by restaurant, cuisine, or dish name)
Cards show rating, delivery time, price range, and badges (Popular / Trending / Fast delivery)

2. Menu Management

Each restaurant has its own categorized menu (Mains, Starters, Breads, Drinks, etc.)
Category tabs to jump between sections
Per-item add/quantity controls with live stepper (+ / −)

3. Cart Functionality

Slide-out cart drawer with running item list
Quantity edits sync live between menu view and cart
Auto-calculated subtotal, delivery fee, taxes, and total

4. Checkout & Payment Integration

Delivery details form (name, address, phone, pincode)
Payment method selector: UPI / Card / Cash on Delivery
Card flow reveals number/expiry/CVV fields with basic validation
Form validation before order placement

5. Order Tracking

Post-checkout tracking modal with unique order ID
Animated 4-stage progress: Confirmed → Preparing → Out for delivery → Delivered
Auto-advances stages over time to simulate live tracking
Design
Custom visual identity: charcoal + cream palette with orange/basil accents, Fraunces (display) + Manrope (body) + JetBrains Mono (data/labels)
"Order ticket" motif in the hero, receipt-style dashed lines, tactile chip/pill UI
Fully responsive down to mobile
